        "description": "<p><strong>What it does (SRD):</strong> In <strong>starlight, moonlight, torchlight, and similar dim lighting</strong>, the creature can see <strong>twice as far</strong> as a human can in the same light. It retains the ability to distinguish color and detail under those conditions that a human could not.</p><p><strong>ThirdEra:</strong> Low-light vision is set on this item’s <strong>Details</strong> tab under <strong>Capability grants</strong> (vision and senses), not in <strong>Mechanical effects</strong> (no extra distance is needed for the usual reading of the rule). The character sheet includes it with other vision from items and race.</p>",
